<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SIMBA PASAR - Simulasi Belanja di Pasar Tradisional</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Tone.js untuk efek suara & nada pelafalan angka tanpa ketergantungan TTS yang sering error -->
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/tone/14.8.49/Tone.js"></script>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Nunito & Fredoka untuk tampilan ramah anak & edukatif -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@500;600;700&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
            background-color: #FEF9E7;
            color: #2C3E50;
            user-select: none;
        }
        h1, h2, h3, .font-display {
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
        }
        /* Pola tenda pasar tradisional di header */
        .market-awning {
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(
                90deg,
                #D9534F,
                #D9534F 24px,
                #FFF8E7 24px,
                #FFF8E7 48px
            );
            height: 16px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #B52B27;
        }
        /* Animasi halus */
        @keyframes popIn {
            0% { transform: scale(0.92); opacity: 0; }
            100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }
        .animate-pop {
            animation: popIn 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275) forwards;
        }
        .btn-3d {
            transition: all 0.1s ease;
            border-bottom-width: 4px;
        }
        .btn-3d:active {
            transform: translateY(2px);
            border-bottom-width: 2px;
        }
        /* Uang kertas & koin realistis */
        .banknote {
            transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
        }
        .banknote:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }
        .coin {
            border-radius: 9999px;
            transition: transform 0.15s ease;
        }
        .coin:hover {
            transform: scale(1.08);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col">

    <!-- Top Awning Dekorasi Pasar -->
    <div class="market-awning w-full sticky top-0 z-40"></div>

    <!-- Navbar / Header Utama (Muncul setelah layar pembuka) -->
    <header id="main-header" class="hidden bg-amber-500 text-white shadow-md sticky top-4 z-30 mx-2 sm:mx-6 mt-2 rounded-2xl border-2 border-amber-600">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer" onclick="navigateTo('menu')">
                <div class="bg-white text-amber-600 p-2 rounded-xl font-display font-bold text-lg shadow-inner">
                    🏪 SIMBA PASAR
                </div>
                <span class="hidden md:inline text-sm font-bold text-amber-100">Matematika Kelas 5 • Bilangan Cacah s.d. 100.000</span>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Navigasi Non-Linear (Revisi Poin 8) -->
            <nav class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2">
                <button onclick="navigateTo('menu')" class="nav-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold transition">🏠 Menu Utama</button>
                <button onclick="navigateTo('guide')" class="nav-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold transition">📖 Petunjuk & Tujuan</button>
                <button onclick="navigateTo('materi')" class="nav-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold transition">📚 Materi</button>
                <button onclick="navigateTo('kasir')" class="nav-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-sky-600 hover:bg-sky-700 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold transition">🛒 Latihan Kasir</button>
                <button onclick="navigateTo('kuis')" class="nav-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold transition">📝 Kuis (10 Soal)</button>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Notifikasi / Toast Message (Pengganti alert() sesuai standar) -->
    <div id="toast-box" class="fixed bottom-5 right-5 z-50 max-w-sm hidden animate-pop">
        <div id="toast-content" class="bg-rose-600 text-white px-5 py-4 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border-2 border-white flex items-start gap-3">
            <span id="toast-icon" class="text-2xl">⚠️</span>
            <div>
                <h4 id="toast-title" class="font-bold text-base">Peringatan</h4>
                <p id="toast-msg" class="text-sm text-rose-100 mt-0.5">Pesan notifikasi.</p>
            </div>
            <button onclick="hideToast()" class="ml-auto text-white/80 hover:text-white font-bold">✕</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- KONTEN UTAMA -->
    <main class="flex-grow max-w-6xl w-full mx-auto px-4 py-6">

        <!-- =========================================================
             HALAMAN 0: LAYAR PEMBUKA (SPLASH SCREEN)
        ========================================================= -->
        <section id="view-splash" class="min-h-[80vh] flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center animate-pop">
            <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-xl border-4 border-amber-400 max-w-2xl w-full relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="inline-block bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-bold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm mb-4 border border-amber-300">
                    Media Pembelajaran Interaktif Berbasis Etnomatematika
                </div>
                
                <!-- Ilustrasi SVG Pasar Tradisional (Bukan Emoji Polos - Revisi Poin 5) -->
                <div class="w-48 h-36 mx-auto mb-4">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 240 160" class="w-full h-full drop-shadow">
                        <!-- Latar langit & kios -->
                        <rect x="20" y="55" width="200" height="90" rx="10" fill="#FDE68A" stroke="#D97706" stroke-width="3"/>
                        <!-- Atap Tenda -->
                        <path d="M10 55 L35 20 L205 20 L230 55 Z" fill="#EF4444" stroke="#B91C1C" stroke-width="3"/>
                        <path d="M45 20 L35 55 L75 55 L80 20 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
                        <path d="M115 20 L110 55 L150 55 L145 20 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
                        <path d="M180 20 L185 55 L215 55 L200 20 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
                        <!-- Meja Dagangan -->
                        <rect x="30" y="95" width="180" height="45" rx="6" fill="#B45309" stroke="#78350F" stroke-width="3"/>
                        <!-- Keranjang Sayur & Buah -->
                        <circle cx="65" cy="88" r="14" fill="#16A34A"/>
                        <circle cx="80" cy="86" r="12" fill="#22C55E"/>
                        <circle cx="120" cy="88" r="14" fill="#DC2626"/>
                        <circle cx="135" cy="87" r="11" fill="#F97316"/>
                        <rect x="160" y="75" width="35" height="20" rx="4" fill="#FEF3C7" stroke="#D97706" stroke-width="2"/>
                        <text x="177" y="89" font-size="9" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" fill="#92400E">BERAS</text>
                        <!-- Papan Nama -->
                        <rect x="75" y="105" width="90" height="24" rx="5" fill="#FEF08A" stroke="#CA8A04" stroke-width="2"/>
                        <text x="120" y="121" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" fill="#854D0E">PASAR RAKYAT</text>
                    </svg>
                </div>

                <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-amber-600 tracking-tight mb-2">
                    SIMBA PASAR
                </h1>
                <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-700 mb-3">
                    Simulasi Belanja di Pasar Tradisional
                </p>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base mb-8 max-w-lg mx-auto">
                    Belajar membaca, menulis, menentukan nilai tempat, membandingkan, serta menghitung transaksi uang Rupiah hingga <strong>Rp99.999</strong> (Bilangan Cacah s.d. 100.000).
                </p>

                <button onclick="startApp()" class="btn-3d bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-600 border-emerald-700 text-white font-display text-xl px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl shadow-lg w-full sm:w-auto">
                    Mulai Belajar Sekarang 🚀
                </button>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- =========================================================
             HALAMAN 1: PETUNJUK PENGGUNAAN & TUJUAN PEMBELAJARAN (Revisi Poin 7 & 11)
        ========================================================= -->
        <section id="view-guide" class="hidden animate-pop space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-lg border-2 border-amber-300">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b-2 border-amber-100 pb-4 mb-6">
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-amber-700">📖 Petunjuk Penggunaan & Tujuan Pembelajaran</h2>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Pahami alur belajar dan fungsi setiap tombol sebelum memulai aktivitas.</p>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="navigateTo('menu')" class="btn-3d bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 border-amber-700 text-white font-bold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl">
                        Lanjut ke Menu Utama ➡️
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                    <!-- Tujuan Pembelajaran & Rasional Batas 100.000 (Revisi Poin 7 & 11) -->
                    <div class="bg-emerald-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-emerald-200 space-y-3">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 flex items-center gap-2">
                            🎯 Tujuan Pembelajaran (Kelas 5)
                        </h3>
                        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700 list-disc pl-5">
                            <li>Siswa mampu <strong>membaca dan menulis</strong> lambang bilangan cacah sampai 100.000 dengan tepat.</li>
                            <li>Siswa mampu menentukan <strong>nilai tempat</strong> (puluh ribuan, ribuan, ratusan, puluhan, satuan) dari harga barang.</li>
                            <li>Siswa mampu <strong>membandingkan dan mengurutkan</strong> harga barang menggunakan konsep etnomatematika pasar tradisional (satuan ikat, liter, kg, kodi, lusin, dan tawar-menawar).</li>
                            <li>Siswa mampu menyelesaikan operasi hitung penjumlahan dan pengurangan uang kembalian pada simulasi kasir.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-emerald-300 text-xs text-slate-600">
                            <strong class="text-emerald-700 block mb-1">📌 Rasional Batas Belanja Maksimal Rp99.999 (ATP Kelas 5):</strong>
                            Sesuai Capaian Pembelajaran Fase C (Kelas 5), fokus utama adalah penguasaan nilai tempat <strong>5 digit (puluh ribuan hingga satuan)</strong> pada bilangan cacah sampai 100.000. Oleh karena itu, total belanja dibatasi maksimal <strong>Rp99.999</strong> agar siswa berlatih membaca 5 nilai tempat secara utuh dan menghindari kembalian negatif.
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Alur Belajar & Fungsi Tombol -->
                    <div class="bg-sky-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-sky-200 space-y-3">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-sky-800 flex items-center gap-2">
                            🧭 Alur Belajar & Fungsi Tombol
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">
                            Media ini bersifat <strong>fleksibel (non-linear)</strong>. Kamu bebas memilih menu sesuai kebutuhan pemahamanmu:
                        </p>
                        <div class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
                            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-sky-200 flex items-start gap-3">
                                <span class="bg-emerald-500 text-white font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs shrink-0">📚 Materi</span>
                                <p class="text-slate-600">Belajar membaca/menulis bilangan bertahap, nilai tempat 5 digit, audio pelafalan, serta mengenal satuan khas pasar (ikat, liter, lusin, kodi).</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-sky-200 flex items-start gap-3">
                                <span class="bg-sky-500 text-white font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs shrink-0">🛒 Kasir</span>
                                <p class="text-slate-600">Praktik menjadi kasir pasar! Menjumlahkan belanjaan (maks. Rp99.999), melakukan <strong>tawar-menawar</strong>, memecah nilai tempat, dan menghitung kembalian.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-sky-200 flex items-start gap-3">
                                <span class="bg-purple-500 text-white font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs shrink-0">📝 Kuis</span>
                                <p class="text-slate-600">Mengerjakan <strong>10 soal evaluasi</strong> lengkap dengan pembahasan mendetail di setiap nomor (baik jawaban benar maupun salah).</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-sky-200 flex items-start gap-3">
                                <span class="bg-amber-500 text-white font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs shrink-0">🔊 Audio</span>
                                <p class="text-slate-600">Tekan tombol speaker pada contoh bilangan untuk mendengarkan pelafalan angka yang jernih dan terukur.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- =========================================================
             HALAMAN 2: MENU UTAMA NON-LINEAR (Revisi Poin 8)
        ========================================================= -->
        <section id="view-menu" class="hidden animate-pop space-y-6">
            <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-amber-800">Pilih Aktivitas Belajarmu</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-600 mt-1">Kamu bisa langsung memilih menu mana saja sesuai dengan pemahamanmu hari ini!</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
                <!-- Kartu 1: Petunjuk & Tujuan -->
                <div onclick="navigateTo('guide')" class="cursor-pointer bg-white hover:bg-amber-50 rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl border-2 border-amber-300 transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-4 font-bold">📖</div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">1. Petunjuk & Tujuan</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Baca tujuan pembelajaran, fungsi tombol, dan panduan penggunaan media.</p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="mt-5 inline-block text-amber-600 font-bold text-sm">Buka Panduan →</span>
                </div>

                <!-- Kartu 2: Materi & Etnomatematika -->
                <div onclick="navigateTo('materi')" class="cursor-pointer bg-white hover:bg-emerald-50 rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl border-2 border-emerald-400 transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-4 font-bold">📚</div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">2. Materi & Latihan</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Membaca & menulis lambang bilangan bertahap, nilai tempat, dan satuan pasar tradisional.</p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="mt-5 inline-block text-emerald-600 font-bold text-sm">Pelajari Materi →</span>
                </div>

                <!-- Kartu 3: Simulasi Kasir Pasar -->
                <div onclick="navigateTo('kasir')" class="cursor-pointer bg-white hover:bg-sky-50 rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl border-2 border-sky-400 transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-sky-100 text-sky-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-4 font-bold">🛒</div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">3. Latihan Kasir Pasar</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Simulasi jual-beli nyata! Ada fitur tawar-menawar, uang Rupiah asli, dan batas Rp99.999.</p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="mt-5 inline-block text-sky-600 font-bold text-sm">Mainkan Kasir →</span>
                </div>

                <!-- Kartu 4: Kuis Evaluasi 10 Soal -->
                <div onclick="navigateTo('kuis')" class="cursor-pointer bg-white hover:bg-purple-50 rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl border-2 border-purple-400 transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-4 font-bold">📝</div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">4. Kuis Evaluasi</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">10 soal lengkap sesuai kisi-kisi dengan pembahasan di setiap nomor.</p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="mt-5 inline-block text-purple-600 font-bold text-sm">Kerjakan Kuis →</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- =========================================================
             HALAMAN 3: MATERI, ETNOMATEMATIKA & LATIHAN BERTAHAP (Revisi Poin 2, 10, 13)
        ========================================================= -->
        <section id="view-materi" class="hidden animate-pop space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-lg border-2 border-emerald-300">
                <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-800 mb-2">📚 Materi Etnomatematika Pasar Tradisional</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-6">Pelajari konsep bilangan cacah sampai 100.000 melalui aktivitas jual beli dan satuan tradisional di pasar.</p>

                <!-- Tab Sub-Materi -->
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-6 border-b pb-4">
                    <button onclick="switchMateriTab('tab-bilangan')" id="btn-tab-bilangan" class="materi-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm bg-emerald-600 text-white">1. Membaca & Nilai Tempat</button>
                    <button onclick="switchMateriTab('tab-etno')" id="btn-tab-etno" class="materi-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 hover:bg-emerald-200">2. Satuan Khas Pasar (Etnomatematika)</button>
                    <button onclick="switchMateriTab('tab-latihan-bertahap')" id="btn-tab-latihan-bertahap" class="materi-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 hover:bg-emerald-200">3. Latihan Bertahap Menulis Bilangan</button>
                </div>

                <!-- TAB 1: MEMBACA, NILAI TEMPAT & AUDIO REKAMAN/SINTESIS TERUKUR (Revisi Poin 10 & 13) -->
                <div id="tab-bilangan" class="materi-panel space-y-6">
                    <div class="bg-amber-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-amber-900 mb-2">🔊 Contoh Membaca Harga & Nilai Tempat 5 Digit</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 mb-4">Klik tombol <strong>Dengarkan Suara</strong> pada setiap kartu harga untuk mendengar pelafalan bilangan dengan jelas (menggunakan audio terkalibrasi tanpa bergantung pada TTS peramban yang sering bisu).</p>
                        
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4" id="contoh-bilangan-container">
                            <!-- Diisi via JS agar interaktif -->
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Tabel Nilai Tempat Interaktif -->
                    <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-800 mb-3">🔍 Bedah Nilai Tempat Harga Barang</h3>
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-600">Pilih Contoh Harga:</span>
                            <button onclick="showNilaiTempat(47850)" class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-emerald-100 hover:bg-emerald-200 text-emerald-800 font-bold rounded-lg text-sm">Rp47.850</button>
                            <button onclick="showNilaiTempat(95204)" class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-emerald-100 hover:bg-emerald-200 text-emerald-800 font-bold rounded-lg text-sm">Rp95.204</button>
                            <button onclick="showNilaiTempat(68500)" class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-emerald-100 hover:bg-emerald-200 text-emerald-800 font-bold rounded-lg text-sm">Rp68.500</button>
                            <button onclick="showNilaiTempat(80450)" class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-emerald-100 hover:bg-emerald-200 text-emerald-800 font-bold rounded-lg text-sm">Rp80.450</button>
                        </div>

                        <div id="nilai-tempat-display" class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-2 text-center">
                            <!-- Diisi via JS -->
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- TAB 2: UNSUR ETNOMATEMATIKA PASAR TRADISIONAL (Revisi Poin 2 & 6) -->
                <div id="tab-etno" class="materi-panel hidden space-y-5">
                    <div class="bg-amber-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-amber-900 mb-2">🧺 Satuan Takaran & Hitungan Khas Pasar Tradisional</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">Di pasar tradisional Indonesia, pedagang tidak hanya menggunakan kilogram, tetapi juga satuan kelompok berbasis budaya lokal (etnomatematika). Memahami satuan ini membantu kita membandingkan harga secara adil!</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
                        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border-2 border-emerald-200 shadow-sm">
                            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-700 mb-1">1 Ikat</div>
                            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-2">Sayuran (Kangkung, Bayam, Kacang Panjang)</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">Kumpulan sayuran yang diikat tali bambu/rafia. Contoh: 1 ikat bayam Rp3.500. Jika beli 3 ikat = <strong>Rp10.500</strong>.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border-2 border-sky-200 shadow-sm">
                            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-sky-700 mb-1">1 Liter / Takar</div>
                            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-2">Beras & Kacang-kacangan</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">Takaran volume tradisional berbentuk kaleng silinder. 1 liter beras ≈ 0,8 kg. Contoh: 1 liter beras Rp12.500.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border-2 border-amber-200 shadow-sm">
                            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-700 mb-1">1 Lusin = 12 Buah</div>
                            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-2">Peralatan Dapur & Gelas</p>
